// BridgeDeck source sync (Syncthing folder id: bridgedeck-source).
// Sync source code only. Each computer keeps its own dependencies and build output.
// Syncthing does not sync this file: keep an identical copy on every computer. See docs/SOURCE_SYNC.md.
// First matching pattern wins, so the exception comes before /runtime/*.
!/runtime/README.md
/runtime/*
/vendor
/node_modules
/dist
/src-tauri/target
/src-tauri/gen
*.tsbuildinfo
(?d).DS_Store
(?d)Thumbs.db
(?d)desktop.ini
